I sort of like the alternative of just going in there with a
couple of scrolls of earth and a wand of striking or spell
of force bolt.  If solving Sokoban type puzzles isn't your
cup of tea, brute force has always been a favorite NetHack
play style (says the guy who's never ascended, of course).

